ing free table-game meetup open to teens and adults.","evidence_claim":"Los Angeles County calls Game Night a free community event for ages 14 and older, held Tuesdays at Burton Chace Park.","source_url":"https://beaches.lacounty.gov/events/burton-chace-park-gamenight/","source_title":"Game Night at Burton Chace Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":"2026-05-05","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The current repeating schedule lists Tuesdays from 5:30–7:30 p.m. Walk-up participation is allowed; optional Eventbrite registration is encouraged.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"yoga-with-david-lilly-2026","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Yoga with David Lilly","title":"Stretch at a Free Yoga Class","subtitle":"Monday sessions at Burton Chace Park","notes":"Register by email, wear clothes suitable for movement, and bring any personal mat or water you need without assuming supplies are available.","short_summary":"A free instructor-led session focused on yoga fundamentals.","evidence_claim":"Los Angeles County lists Yoga with David Lilly at Burton Chace Park as free and schedules it on Mondays from 6:30 to 7:30 p.m.","source_url":"https://beaches.lacounty.gov/events/yoga-with-david-lilly-bcp/var/ri-20.l-L1/","source_title":"Yoga with David Lilly in Marina del Rey - FREE","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Mondays, 6:30–7:30 p.m., at Burton Chace Park. Registration is required by email to chacepark@bh.lacounty.gov.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"burton-chace-walking-club","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Burton Chace Park Walking Club","title":"Take a Harbor Walking Break","subtitle":"Free public group walks on Tuesdays and Thursdays","notes":"Call ahead to RSVP, wear comfortable shoes, and join the one-hour group walk for an easy social reset with marina views.","short_summary":"A recurring public exercise hour with no participation fee.","evidence_claim":"Los Angeles County states that the Burton Chace Park Walking Club is offered free to the public every Tuesday and Thursday.","source_url":"https://beaches.lacounty.gov/events/burton-chace-park-thursday-walking-club/","source_title":"Burton Chace Park Walking Club - Free","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Every Tuesday and Thursday, 10:30–11:30 a.m. RSVP by calling 424-526-7910 before attending.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"marina-drum-circle-2026","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Marina Drum Circle","title":"Build a Beat at the Marina","subtitle":"Free all-ages Sunday sessions at Burton Chace Park","notes":"Reserve a free ticket for one of the two sessions, then arrive ready to create rhythms together; Remo drums are provided for participants.","short_summary":"A guided all-ages rhythm session with instruments supplied.","evidence_claim":"Los Angeles County describes Marina Drum Circle as a free, all-ages event and says free tickets are available for two capacity-limited sessions.","source_url":"https://beaches.lacounty.gov/drumcircle/","source_title":"Marina Drum Circle","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Sundays from August 16 through October 18, 2026, at 11:30 a.m. or 1:30 p.m. A free Eventbrite reservation is required because capacity is limited.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"dance-mdr-2026","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Dance MDR","title":"Learn a Dance by the Harbor","subtitle":"Free Friday-night lessons and DJ sets at Burton Chace Park","notes":"Reserve a free spot, arrive when doors open, and follow the beginner lesson before staying for the DJ-led social dancing.","short_summary":"An evening of beginner instruction followed by open dancing.","evidence_claim":"Los Angeles County says Dance MDR is free to the public, welcomes everyone, and offers beginner lessons followed by dancing to a DJ.","source_url":"https://beaches.lacounty.gov/dancemdr/","source_title":"Dance MDR","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Listed for Friday nights in September 2026. Doors open at 6:30 p.m. and dancing begins at 7 p.m.; free admission requires an Eventbrite RSVP.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
